#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.1.rst:4
msgid "v2.4.1"
msgstr "v2.4.1"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.1.rst:6
msgid ""
"v2.4.1 is a small maintenance release: it adds ``b_and()`` / ``b_or()`` / "
"``b_nand()`` / ``b_nor()`` / ``b_xor()`` / ``b_xnor()`` aliases for the "
"binary image operations and applies USB-MSC (SCSI layer) and Kanji fixes "
"from MicroPython upstream. It introduces **no breaking API changes** — "
"v2.4.0 scripts run unchanged."
msgstr ""
"v2.4.1 adalah rilis pemeliharaan kecil: menambahkan alias ``b_and()`` / "
"``b_or()`` / ``b_nand()`` / ``b_nor()`` / ``b_xor()`` / ``b_xnor()`` untuk "
"operasi citra biner dan menerapkan perbaikan USB-MSC (lapisan SCSI) dan "
"Kanji dari upstream MicroPython. Rilis ini **tidak memperkenalkan perubahan "
"API yang merusak kompatibilitas** — skrip v2.4.0 berjalan tanpa perubahan."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.1.rst:15
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "On this page"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.1.rst:18
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Highlights"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.1.rst:20
msgid ""
"**Binary-op aliases** — added ``b_and()`` / ``b_or()`` / ``b_nand()`` / "
"``b_nor()`` / ``b_xor()`` / ``b_xnor()`` (the existing ``and()`` / ``or()`` "
"/ … names still work)."
msgstr ""
"**Alias operasi biner** — ditambahkan ``b_and()`` / ``b_or()`` / "
"``b_nand()`` / ``b_nor()`` / ``b_xor()`` / ``b_xnor()`` (nama ``and()`` / "
"``or()`` / … yang sudah ada tetap berfungsi)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.1.rst:23
msgid ""
"**Upstream fixes** — USB MSC (SCSI layer) and Kanji fixes from MicroPython."
msgstr ""
"**Perbaikan upstream** — perbaikan USB MSC (lapisan SCSI) dan Kanji dari "
"MicroPython."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.1.rst:24
msgid ""
"**No breaking API changes** — reflash and your v2.4.0 scripts run unchanged."
msgstr ""
"**Tidak ada perubahan API yang merusak kompatibilitas** — flash ulang dan "
"skrip v2.4.0 Anda berjalan tanpa perubahan."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.1.rst:28
msgid "New features"
msgstr "Fitur baru"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.1.rst:30
msgid ""
"Added ``b_and()`` / ``b_nand()`` / ``b_or()`` / ``b_nor()`` / ``b_xor()`` / "
"``b_xnor()`` method names for the binary image operations as clearer "
"aliases; the original ``and()`` / ``nand()`` / ``or()`` / ``nor()`` / "
"``xor()`` / ``xnor()`` names continue to work. Updated the binary-ops "
"documentation."
msgstr ""
"Ditambahkan nama metode ``b_and()`` / ``b_nand()`` / ``b_or()`` / "
"``b_nor()`` / ``b_xor()`` / ``b_xnor()`` untuk operasi citra biner sebagai "
"alias yang lebih jelas; nama asli ``and()`` / ``nand()`` / ``or()`` / "
"``nor()`` / ``xor()`` / ``xnor()`` terus berfungsi. Dokumentasi operasi "
"biner diperbarui."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.1.rst:37
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "Perbaikan bug"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.1.rst:39
msgid ""
"Applied the USB mass-storage SCSI-layer fix and the Kanji fix from "
"MicroPython upstream."
msgstr ""
"Menerapkan perbaikan SCSI-layer penyimpanan massal USB dan perbaikan Kanji "
"dari upstream MicroPython."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.1.rst:43
msgid "Breaking API changes"
msgstr "Perubahan API yang merusak kompatibilitas"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.1.rst:45
msgid ""
"v2.4.1 introduces **no breaking Python API changes**. Scripts that ran on "
"v2.4.0 run unchanged on v2.4.1 — just reflash the firmware."
msgstr ""
"v2.4.1 **tidak memperkenalkan perubahan API Python yang merusak "
"kompatibilitas**\\ . Skrip yang berjalan pada v2.4.0 berjalan tanpa "
"perubahan pada v2.4.1 — cukup flash ulang firmware."
